PARITY NOTES
  • Data source: useLiveConnection → P1/S8 source seam emitting LiveConnectionSnapshot
    {status, lastMessageAt}. No HTTP in the view. The web hook's compute step (raw sse
    state + 10s RECONNECTING_GRACE promotion + never-connected→unknown) is reproduced
    faithfully in LiveConnectionStatus.derive(...) and unit + runtime tested.
  • 4 statuses (web cfg table): connected→success/wifi/"Live"(+freshness on pill),
    reconnecting→warning/spinning loader/"Reconnecting…", disconnected→danger/wifi.slash/
    "Offline", unknown→muted/wifi.slash/"Unknown". The web has NO skeleton/spinner-only gate,
    so unknown IS the initial/loading state and disconnected IS the offline/error state — that
    mapping is reproduced rather than inventing chrome the source lacks (no silent drift).
  • 3 variants: pill (chip + icon + label + "· {relative}"), dot (bare colored dot), compact
    (chip + icon + label, no stamp). Freshness stamp gated to pill+connected+lastMessageAt.
  • i18n: every label/phrase via NSLocalizedString(table "LiveIndicator"); no English literals
    in code. Relative phrases (web-hardcoded in dateFormat.ts) routed through the facade.
  • a11y: one VoiceOver element, label=status, value=freshness, .updatesFrequently (web
    role="status" live region); spinner gated on accessibilityReduceMotion; SF Symbols scale
    with Dynamic Type. Telemetry: view.opened surface=LiveIndicator emitted once on appear.

